{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_12_level_main_12-09_end",
  "groupId": "main_12",
  "stageId": "main_12-09",
  "title": "广播热线正繁忙",
  "storyCode": "12-10",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_12-09_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d8a9ada193ba7f8e017f821bc874f3118f173f161f5a2632a65dc6482933cbd9",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "W，也许你的车可以再开慢一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们的重伤员女士可耽搁不起，闪灵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抓稳扶好，各位，我们又要过坡啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这种颠簸可能并不有利于凯尔希的恢复。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那又怎样，特雷西斯没砍死她，这一点小小的颠簸难道还会要了她的命？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哇喔，这里的路况真差，我们得穿过这片弹坑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你可以绕开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "太晚了，我已经开进去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（威胁的低吼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行了，凯尔希的小宠物，把你的爪子从我身上挪开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "或者你可以滚下车，拖着你的可怜主人跟着我们，你自己选。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（高昂的嘶鸣）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的那个金属脑壳里在琢磨什么小计划？你可以试试，我乐意奉陪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "或者，我该直接把你丢到车轮子底下铺路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "W，赶路要紧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现在这女人的嘴里可是一个字都吐不出来，瞧她那小宠物急得要死，又畏畏缩缩的样子！我这辈子还没心情这么好过！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你就不想报复报复自己的上司吗？在医疗部呼风唤雨的凯尔希，如今落得个这副下场啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现在她是我的病人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啧，你还是和以前一样无聊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "告诉可露希尔那帮人，按照我们走的路线跟上来，大公爵和萨卡兹打得热火朝天，也就我知道哪里还有口子了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你很熟悉这一带的地形和情况。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你以为这几年我是怎么活下来的？靠在伦蒂尼姆的下水道里游泳吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "佣兵向来用佣兵的办法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "穿过这一片废墟，就到了我们的目的地了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她已经在那里了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当然，我可不会放过让别人欠我人情的机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过，搬轮椅要另外收费，你多欠我一次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说起来，你和那女的什么关系？把残疾人拖进伦蒂尼姆可不是个好主意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她是我的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，我是她的罪恶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......一座通讯站？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们需要把我们的存在广播出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "这是一次邀请。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "您很敏锐，罗德岛的博士。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "大公爵们需要知道这一点。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "如果有人不行动，这就是其他大公爵指责他们的把柄。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "在王冠空悬的此刻，谁都不会想给竞争对手留下口实。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "您比我想象的还要了解维多利亚。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "哪里能找到通讯站？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "这座地块的信号中枢在一开始就被萨卡兹摧毁了，但我知道，还有一处小型通讯站也许可以使用。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "它在一家酒店里。这家酒店在诺伯特区衰落之前，是伦蒂尼姆最好的住处之一。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "为了满足各个国家旅客的要求，他们给酒店装上了一台功率十分强劲的信号收发装置。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那里现在从外面看已经被落石堵死了，但如果我们能找到进去的路，并且使用那里残存的设备，应该......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "这会是个十分危险的行动，按你刚刚的描述，就算那座可怜的通讯站依然可以运行，恐怕发出的信号也无法实现加密。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "没错，那是个老旧的民用型号。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "无论是谁，都能马上知道我们想说的是什么。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "萨卡兹们也会马上行动起来。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我们只能赌那些公爵们不想背上坐视一场屠杀发生的恶名。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "并且，我相信......会有大公爵挺身而出的，终究他们也不想看到一个沦为废墟的维多利亚。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "比如那位温德米尔公爵？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "也许她会是其中之一。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "很有意思，看来你确实看了很多报纸，戴菲恩。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，阿米娅，我认为这个计划确实有可行之处，我们需要一点混乱来打破僵局。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "无论是引出那艘不知道藏在哪里的飞空艇，还是给撤离被抛出的地块上的人提供机会，一位或几位大公爵的进攻都能成为我们的掩护。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推进之王",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那么，在此之前，我们就需要停止这片封锁区中毫无意义的互相争抢、互相杀戮。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我们必须得给他们一个重新团结在一起的理由。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "比如，让每个人都知道希望的存在。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "是的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "如果我们能更进一步，让封锁区里剩下的物资能够更好地分配给有需要的人......也许我们坚持的时间还能更长。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "正如您之前说的，重新建立起已经崩塌的信任。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "哼，不管是真是假，希望总归是希望。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "卡铎尔",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "所以，这就是各位的天才计划，去那老酒店找到个老通讯站，然后告诉外面的那帮公爵我们在这里生不如死，求他们救救我们？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "卡铎尔",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "太精彩了，我简直要为你们鼓掌。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "如果你有什么好主意，可以大大方方说出来，卡铎尔。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "除了冲倒萨卡兹的封锁墙之外。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "卡铎尔",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我只是没有想到，在成为小偷和骗子之后，我们终究要向那帮让人恶心的大人物摇尾乞怜了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "如果你不喜欢称这次行动为一次求援，你也可以认为这是一次博弈。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "卡铎尔",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "瞧瞧，多高级的词啊，“博弈”！我们居然能有和那帮藏在城堡里的人博弈的机会！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你也可以继续选择去街上抢人，我不拦着你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "卡铎尔",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "这是两码事！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "卡铎尔，我知道你很在乎你的那些“尊严”，但眼下不是说这些的时候。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "如果大公爵的进攻能够帮助我们，邀请他们就是个选择。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "卡铎尔",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那么，你想过结果吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "卡铎尔",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "大公爵们帮助了我们，多美好，然后呢？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "卡铎尔",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "登上他们的战舰，向我们伟大的伦蒂尼姆进军？还是成为他们的属民，在开斯特或者威灵顿的工厂把自己喂给那些车床？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "卡铎尔",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "这*维多利亚粗口*不会是一次恩典，这只会是把我们的命卖给了那些贵族老爷！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "卡铎尔",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "从此，我们就再也不是诺伯特人，而是一帮任由他们揉捏的难民！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "难道我们现在不是吗？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "卡铎尔！难道现在我们就是什么自由惬意的诺伯特人吗？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "战争开始了！我们已经身在其中了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你以为，按照你的那些想法，倘若真的有一位什么天降英雄和你一起带领诺伯特区的人，把外面的那些萨卡兹打得落花流水——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "原来的一切就能回来吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "“尊严”，看看我们吧！卡铎尔！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我们都清楚......自己干了什么！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "卡铎尔",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "卡铎尔",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推进之王",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "该死，怎么了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "卡铎尔",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "街上！都拿起武器！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "贝尔德",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "先别急，我们得弄清楚——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "贝尔德",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "他们是不想活命了吗？谁还有力气去打一场这么激烈的架？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "贝尔德",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "现在每个躲在封锁区里的小团伙应该都和我们一样，物资告急了才对——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "透过被钉上的窗户，只能看到还未消散的烟尘。\n然后就是吼叫与咒骂，还有哭泣与求饶。在这些日子里，他们已经不得不习惯对它们充耳不闻，熟视无睹。\n然而这次，它不再是在暗巷中短暂炸响，不再伴随着忐忑或犹豫，遮掩或伪装。\n烟尘中，一辆行李车正在街道上缓缓滑动，它或许曾经属于某家酒店，用来搬运远道而来的客人们携带的大小提箱。\n如今，它却被爆炸的余波推出烟尘，它成了这一刻所有人目光聚集的焦点，所有人炽烈的渴望。\n那辆行李车上，竟载满了物资。一箱箱罐头，干净的水，粗糙而甜美的干粮......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "贝尔德",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那是......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "她的声音含混不清，她察觉到自己......无法移开眼睛。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "绝望的暴徒",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我......我需要这些食物，给我滚开！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "激动的暴徒",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "该躲开的是你，该死的，我不想找你的麻烦，你吃不了那么多！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "绝望的暴徒",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你可以分我一点，哪怕是几块面包都足够了......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "激动的暴徒",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "先把你的手从那堆东西上放下来！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "人群在争吵着，撕扯着，行李车从一群人的手中被争抢到另一群人手中。\n人们倒下，再度爬起，扑向那堆积如山的希望，期冀于从中攫取到自己的那一份。\n却往往无人遂愿。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "卡铎尔",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "*维多利亚粗口*，这些东西是从哪里来的？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "卡铎尔",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "再过上半个钟头，他们能把自己人都杀光！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "卡铎尔",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "喂，停下，停下！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "贝尔德",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "别过去，现在别。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "贝尔德",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "他们听不进你说的话，我们没有......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "贝尔德察觉一道人影越过了自己。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "贝尔德",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "推进之王！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "推进之王的锤子狠狠砸在地上，气流荡开了弥漫在街道上的烟尘与血腥。\n她看着眼前的这些人，这些人也都死死地盯着她。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "激动的暴徒",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "推进之王......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "激动的暴徒",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你为什么会在这里？你想干什么？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推进之王",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我认得你，阿勒杰，你家的三个小子还好吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "激动的暴徒",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "哈哈哈哈哈，还好吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "激动的暴徒",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "见到他们就知道了，等你死后，或者等我死后。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "激动的暴徒",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "这是好事，他们解脱了，他们不用在这里像畜生一样抢食，他们死得纯洁。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "激动的暴徒",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你呢，推进之王？你打算行行好，送我去见他们吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推进之王",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我们不必如此，在这里对自己的邻居刀剑相向没有意义。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "激动的暴徒",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "太有意义了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "激动的暴徒",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "太有意义了，推进之王，一块面包就足以让我活着度过今晚，如果运气好，还有明晚。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "激动的暴徒",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你不饿吗？你不渴吗？你还有工夫去想着做选择吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "激动的暴徒",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那就说明你还没有充分地被它折磨，你仍置身事外。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "激动的暴徒",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "给我个答案，推进之王，你想从我这里抢走多少希望？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "激动的暴徒",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "以前我打不过你，但现在，我可以——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "激动的暴徒",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "呜——呃啊——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不，停下！先生！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "您不是在施术，您正在毁了自己的身体！这种对于源石技艺适应性的增长只是急性感染的病理性影响！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我们可以帮助您，请停下吧！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "激动的暴徒",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "滚开，滚开！你们这些体面的好人，要不然藏回你们的屋子里，要不然就加入这场争夺！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "激动的暴徒",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "谁都想活下去，这是我所知的最可靠的方法。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "卡铎尔",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "该死，阿勒杰，你就那么想让我把你揍趴下吗？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "卡铎尔",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那么我就——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "摩根",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "行了，已经够了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "摩根",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "亚历山德莉娜·维娜·维多利亚殿下在这里！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推进之王",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "摩根！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "摩根",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "阿斯兰王的后裔，亚历山德莉娜·维娜·维多利亚殿下，带着诸王之息回来了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "绝望的暴徒",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "维多利亚......推进之王，原来你姓维多利亚？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "绝望的暴徒",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那把剑......诸王之息？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "绝望的暴徒",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "可是......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "绝望的暴徒",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我早就怀疑过......你不是普通的菲林。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "遵照殿下的要求，大公爵们的部队已经在前往这里的路上了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那帮萨卡兹拦不住他们，就算加上那艘船也不行！我们现在有救了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推进之王",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "戴菲恩，连你也......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "卡铎尔",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "殿下？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "卡铎尔",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "推进之王......你*维多利亚粗口*是个王室？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "卡铎尔",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "哈哈哈......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "绝望的暴徒",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "大公爵，他们终于——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "绝望的暴徒",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "推进之王......不，亚历山德莉娜殿下，我得......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "激动的暴徒",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "呃呃——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......矿石病的急性症状。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我马上准备抑制剂注射，他的状况很糟。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "摩根",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "看到了吗，我们还有药品！我们只需要再坚持一下——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "摩根",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......真的，我们只需要再坚持一下。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
